  "title": "OAK FELDER EARNS 2026 EMMY NOMINATION",
  "summary": "Today the 2026 Emmy Award nominations were announced, with Oak Felder earning a nod for Outstanding Original Music and Lyrics for “The Devil You Know” by Li Jun Li. Felder co-wrote and produced the song for Amazon Prime’s hit show Spider-Noir. The Emmy Awards will be held live on ABC on September 14 at 8pm […]",
